      "instance_name": "meme_scene",
      "label": "meme_with_text_and_subject",
      "description": "A scene composed of a young girl as the central visual subject, with overlaid text conveying a hateful message about Cinco de Mayo. The text is positioned at the top and bottom of the image, framing the girl as the focal point for the offensive commentary. The girl is standing outdoors, with sunlight casting shadows on her face and body, creating a contrast between her innocent appearance and the hateful message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
